#: contents/ui/ConfigCustom.qml:198
msgid ""
"Commands run with sh, so pipes and && work. A status command tells the tile "
"whether it is on: exit code 0 means on. Without one, the tile remembers the "
"state you last set. Commands that keep running (a server, a program) should "
"be started with something that returns, like systemctl --user start or "
"setsid -f."
msgstr ""
"Amri huendeshwa kwa sh, kwa hivyo mabomba na && hufanya kazi. Amri ya hali "
"huambia kigae kama kimewashwa: exit code 0 inamaanisha kimewashwa. Bila amri "
"hiyo, kigae hukumbuka hali uliyoweka mara ya mwisho. Amri zinazoendelea "
"kufanya kazi (seva, programu) zinapaswa kuanzishwa kwa kitu kinachorudi, "
"kama systemctl --user start au setsid -f."

#: contents/ui/ConfigCustom.qml:209
msgid ""
"The commands run as you, with your permissions. Only use commands you "
"understand and trust."
msgstr ""
"Amri huendeshwa kama wewe, zikiwa na ruhusa zako. Tumia tu amri unazozielewa "
"na kuziamini."

